        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Salvete! I&#39;m a forum rookie who mostly plays digitally. I recently had enough free time to start playing again and I found out that the XTREME Prime Warden cards have been unlocked. I like finding unusual ways to screw with different villains (i.e. triggering Gloomweaver&#39;s insta-lose with Parse) and I was wondering if XTREME Tempest&#39;s &quot;Thunderstruck&quot; was particularly good against certain Villains. So far, all I&#39;ve found is Iron Legecy&#39;s heavy Melee damage and La Capitan&#39;s minions but I feel like I&#39;m missing something big.</p>",
