      {
        "id": 207311,
        "name": "pwatson1974",
        "username": "pwatson1974",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-27T08:20:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wouldn't work on Iron Legacy as it only affects non-character cards.</p><p>Anyone with problematic mionions is good for this. Ctizens Tears, Sweat and Anvil (if you can get a boost). Huginn and Munnin bringing each other back. Voss's spaceships. The Chairman's underbosses bringing thugs into play. And of course it's great for minion damage prevention.</p><p>It's not as good against solo villains like Iron Legacy and most envirnment targets end of plays are damage so less useful for shutting those down. Does not help against the EPE as that's start of turn. Howeve, if you're in the realm of discord, Imbued Vitality makes all those annoying ongoings valid targets and enhances this greatly.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:36:57.818Z",
